<title>EGYPT: Egypt share index closes at record 380.61 points.</title>
<headline>Egypt share index closes at record 380.61 points.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian share prices rose 2.2 percent to close at 380.61 points on Sunday, the eleventh consecutive record high for the all-share index, the Capital Markets Authority said.</p>
<p>It said that it rose 8.43 points from Thursday's close of 372.18.</p>
